      "summaries": {
        "en": "TabPFN is a foundation model for tabular data that outperforms traditional methods like gradient boosting on small-to-medium datasets. It uses a prior-data fitted network (PFN) to learn a Bayesian posterior over model parameters, enabling fast, accurate predictions without hyperparameter tuning. You can use it via scikit-learn API for classification, regression, and imputation, or extend it for few-shot learning and uncertainty estimation.",
        "zh": "TabPFN是一个专为表格数据设计的基础模型，在中小规模数据集上表现优于梯度提升等传统方法。其核心技术是“先验数据拟合网络”（PFN），通过在大规模合成数据上预训练，隐式学习贝叶斯后验分布，从而无需调参即可快速生成准确预测。使用时，你只需像调用scikit-learn一样导入模型，即可完成分类、回归和缺失值填充任务。此外，它还能用于少样本学习和不确定性估计，非常适合快速原型验证或数据探索场景。",
        "es": "TabPFN is a foundation model for tabular data that outperforms traditional methods like gradient boosting on small-to-medium datasets. It uses a prior-data fitted network (PFN) to learn a Bayesian posterior over model parameters, enabling fast, accurate predictions without hyperparameter tuning. You can use it via scikit-learn API for classification, regression, and imputation, or extend it for few-shot learning and uncertainty estimation.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "TabPFN stands out for data-science, foundation-models, and machine-learning in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "TabPFN is a foundation model for tabular data that outperforms traditional methods like gradient boosting on small-to-medium datasets. It uses a prior-data fitted network (PFN) to learn a Bayesian posterior over model parameters, enabling fast, accurate predictions without hyperparameter tuning. You can use it via scikit-learn API for classification, regression, and imputation, or extend it for few-shot learning and uncertainty estimation.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/PriorLabs/TabPFN for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
